WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.123
Robot looked around the playroom.

2
00:00:10.124 --> 00:00:12.691
He snapped his claw.

3
00:00:12.692 --> 00:00:21.667
"Rabbit has been gone for a long time," Robot thought.

4
00:00:21.668 --> 00:00:24.772
Sometimes Robot missed Rabbit.

5
00:00:24.773 --> 00:00:27.453
But most of the time, he didn't.

6
00:00:27.454 --> 00:00:35.290
He liked being the coolest toy in the playroom.

7
00:00:35.291 --> 00:00:39.165
On the floor some toys were playing.

8
00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:45.754
The dinosaurs danced around, stomping loudly.

9
00:00:45.755 --> 00:00:50.390
"Stop being so loud!" Robot yelled.

10
00:00:50.391 --> 00:00:53.186
One dinosaur looked at Robot.

11
00:00:53.187 --> 00:00:57.142
"But Henry is older now," he said.

12
00:00:57.143 --> 00:01:00.862
"He doesn't play with us anymore."

13
00:01:00.863 --> 00:01:03.634
"Yeah," a stuffed animal said.

14
00:01:03.635 --> 00:01:07.331
"Playing on our own is better than nothing."

15
00:01:07.332 --> 00:01:14.568
"I don't care!" Robot said. "Be quiet!"

16
00:01:14.569 --> 00:01:16.804
The room hushed.

17
00:01:16.805 --> 00:01:19.513
"Good!" Robot thought.

18
00:01:19.514 --> 00:01:23.059
Just then Henry came into the room.

19
00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.671
His younger sister, Hope, was with him.

20
00:01:26.672 --> 00:01:29.800
Hope was shy.

21
00:01:29.801 --> 00:01:34.522
She had short hair and wore hearing aids.

22
00:01:34.523 --> 00:01:40.363
"Here he is." Henry picked up Robot.

23
00:01:40.364 --> 00:01:44.909
Robot grinned. "I'm better than the others.

24
00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:49.112
Henry still wants to play with me!" he thought.

25
00:01:49.113 --> 00:01:53.886
But then Henry handed Robot to Hope.

26
00:01:53.887 --> 00:01:57.366
"You can have Robot," Henry said.

27
00:01:57.367 --> 00:02:01.541
"I don't play with him anymore."

28
00:02:01.542 --> 00:02:07.453
"Thanks," Hope said.

29
00:02:07.454 --> 00:02:10.462
She carried Robot down the hall.

30
00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.223
Robot gulped.

31
00:02:12.224 --> 00:02:17.708
"Henry doesn't want me anymore," he thought.

32
00:02:17.709 --> 00:02:20.616
Hope's room was different from the playroom.

33
00:02:20.617 --> 00:02:25.327
Robot saw building sets and science kits.

34
00:02:25.328 --> 00:02:29.700
He saw a light box toy with colorful pegs.

35
00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:32.745
Then Robot spotted something amazing.

36
00:02:32.746 --> 00:02:35.326
There were several posters on the wall.

37
00:02:35.327 --> 00:02:39.405
They showed a strong robot called MechaTron.

38
00:02:39.406 --> 00:02:43.650
In the posters MechaTron flew over buildings.

39
00:02:43.651 --> 00:02:47.192
He fought big monsters.

40
00:02:47.193 --> 00:02:50.335
He shot lasers from his hand.

41
00:02:50.336 --> 00:03:00.701
"Whoa, that robot is a superhero!" Robot thought.

